  "description": "A door's history (protocol §4.8, ADR-020): what the public sees of one door type at one host, from the days the network's own daily-set reads concluded. entry.days are [day, answered, failed]: that day's reads of the daily set that answered and that failed. A day is checked when one concluded, and answered only when none failed; the share shows from min_days checked days, floored; recent is the last recent_days days ending on as_of ('a' every check answered, 'x' one failed, '.' no check); a door whose last check is more than current_days before as_of says from…to instead of since. expect null: never shown.",
